[statement]
Reduced from Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`, 2026-11-11), asked for
`lua-lapis-eswidget`, which needs `lua5.1`, `lua5.1-lapis` and `lua5.2`.
`lua-date`, under `lua5.1-lapis`, needs `lua`, which `lua5.1` and `lua5.2`
both provide at no version, and both are installed. apk installs
`lua-date` right after `lua5.1`, the provider of `lua` it installed first,
and `lua5.2` after `lua5.1-lapis`. Observed; the rule is not yet known.

[repository]
P:lua5.1
V:5.1.5-r13
p:lua

P:lua5.2
V:5.2.4-r13
p:lua

[repository]
P:lua-date
V:2.2.1-r0
D:lua

P:lua-lapis-eswidget
V:1.5.0-r0
D:lua5.1 lua5.1-lapis lua5.2

P:lua5.1-lapis
V:1.18.0-r0
D:lua-date

[request]
lua-lapis-eswidget

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install lua5.1 5.1.5-r13
install lua-date 2.2.1-r0
install lua5.1-lapis 1.18.0-r0
install lua5.2 5.2.4-r13
install lua-lapis-eswidget 1.5.0-r0
